   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.6,
    "text": "Have you ever experienced a panic attack or waking up at the middle of the night in a cold sweat"
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 3.6,
    "end": 6.72,
    "text": "and your heart's racing or just sitting in your car and suddenly you're overwhelmed,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 6.72,
    "end": 11.28,
    "text": "you can't breathe, your head is going a million miles a minute and you're basically having an anxiety attack?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 11.28,
    "end": 13.36,
    "text": "Do you know that that's actually not of God?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 13.36,
    "end": 16.72,
    "text": "God is the author of love, joy and peace and that is not of Him."
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 16.72,
    "end": 21.68,
    "text": "Yet we get so overwhelmed with our circumstances or the issues of life that we take them into our heart."
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 21.68,
    "end": 25.36,
    "text": "God says above all else guard your heart because it's the wellspring of life."
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 25.36,
    "end": 27.44,
    "text": "But do you know that He gives you a scripture to overcome?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 27.44,
    "end": 30.96,
    "text": "the scripture is second to Timothy 1 verse 7. It says this,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 30.96,
    "end": 38.56,
    "text": "For God has not given us a spirit of fear, but of love and of power and of a sound mind."
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 38.56,
    "end": 41.76,
    "text": "God has given you a sound mind. Believe it. Typing in."
   }
  ]
 },
